{
  "annotations": {"list": [{"builtIn": 1, "datasource": {"type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --"}, "enable": true, "hide": false, "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)", "name": "Run annotations", "type": "dashboard"}]},
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [{"asDropdown": false, "includeVars": true, "keepTime": true, "tags": [], "targetBlank": false, "title": "Open Load Diagnostics", "type": "link", "url": "/d/deskseed-load-diagnostics/deskseed-load-diagnostics"}],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 900,
      "title": "Measurement scope",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "description": "실행 필터와 서버 측정 시간의 의미",
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "**Run은 한 번의 k6 실행을 선택합니다.** 서버·DB·호스트 그래프는 선택한 host의 시간대 전체 부하입니다. manifest의 dashboard 링크로 실행의 절대 시간을 맞추세요.\n\nClient percentile은 operation/status별 **실행 누적 분포**이며 최근 구간 서버 percentile과 범위가 다릅니다. `No data`는 0/정상이 아닙니다. 실행 중단·최종 건수·threshold 결과는 runner 결과와 summary/manifest를 확인하세요.\n\n로그·trace·profile은 service/environment/시간으로 연결하며 host 필터가 적용되지 않습니다. 여러 앱 호스트가 동시에 부하를 받으면 해당 신호의 대상도 별도로 확인하세요."}
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "title": "Telemetry target health",
      "description": "exporter scrape 성공 여부입니다. 1이어도 exporter가 감시하는 DB/Redis가 정상인지 별도로 확인합니다. 시계열 부재는 정상 0이 아닙니다.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "unit": "short", "noValue": "No data"}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "up{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",environment=~\"$environment\"}", "legendFormat": "{{job}} {{instance}}", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4}
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "k6에서 관측한 HTTP 요청과 완료 iteration 처리율입니다. Nginx 수신량 또는 업무 성공량과 같다고 간주하지 않습니다. 목표는 iteration/s이며 한 iteration이 여러 HTTP 요청을 수행할 수 있습니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "noValue": "No data", "unit": "reqps"}, "overrides": [{"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "A"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "reqps"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "left"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "reqps"}]}, {"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "B"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "ops"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "ops"}]}]},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4},
      "id": 1,
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum by (scenario) (rate(k6_http_reqs_total{service=\"deskseed\",environment=~\"$environment\",test_run_id=\"$test_run_id\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",profile=~\"$profile\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{scenario}} requests/s", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "sum by (scenario) (rate(k6_iterations_total{service=\"deskseed\",environment=~\"$environment\",test_run_id=\"$test_run_id\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",profile=~\"$profile\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{scenario}} completed iterations/s", "refId": "B"}
      ],
      "title": "Arrived request and iteration rate",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "title": "Run-wide active / maximum VUs",
      "description": "전체 실행 VU입니다. mixed의 개별 scenario 필터를 적용하지 않습니다. 정상상태에서도 서버 지연으로 VU 점유가 길어질 수 있습니다.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "unit": "short", "noValue": "No data"}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "k6_vus{service=\"deskseed\",environment=~\"$environment\",test_run_id=\"$test_run_id\",profile=~\"$profile\"}", "legendFormat": "active VUs", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "k6_vus_max{service=\"deskseed\",environment=~\"$environment\",test_run_id=\"$test_run_id\",profile=~\"$profile\"}", "legendFormat": "maximum VUs", "refId": "B"}
      ],
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12}
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "title": "k6 checks (cumulative)",
      "description": "check별 누적 성공 비율입니다. HTTP 응답 상태뿐 아니라 실제 수신/업무 검증을 확인합니다.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "unit": "percentunit", "noValue": "No data"}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "k6_checks_rate{service=\"deskseed\",environment=~\"$environment\",test_run_id=\"$test_run_id\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",profile=~\"$profile\"}", "legendFormat": "{{scenario}} {{check}}", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 12}
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "operation/status별 실행 누적 p95/p99(초)입니다. k6 2.0.0 remote write는 Time 값을 초로 변환하지만 metric 이름에는 _seconds를 붙이지 않습니다. summary/threshold 예산은 ms입니다. 개별 시계열을 합산하지 않습니다. HTTP duration에는 connection/TLS/blocked 시간이 포함되지 않습니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "unit": "s", "noValue": "No data"}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 20},
      "id": 2,
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "k6_http_req_duration_p95{service=\"deskseed\",environment=~\"$environment\",name=~\"$operation\",test_run_id=\"$test_run_id\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",profile=~\"$profile\"}", "legendFormat": "{{test_run_id}} {{scenario}} {{name}} {{method}} {{status}} {{expected_response}} p95", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "k6_http_req_duration_p99{service=\"deskseed\",environment=~\"$environment\",name=~\"$operation\",test_run_id=\"$test_run_id\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",profile=~\"$profile\"}", "legendFormat": "{{test_run_id}} {{scenario}} {{name}} {{method}} {{status}} {{expected_response}} p99", "refId": "B"}
      ],
      "title": "Client latency p95 / p99",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "예상된 인증 429, k6의 unexpected response rate, backend 5xx를 분리합니다. 서로 합산해 성공률로 해석하지 마세요.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "noValue": "No data", "unit": "ops"}, "overrides": [{"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "A"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "ops"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "left"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "ops"}]}, {"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "B"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "percentunit"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "percentunit"}]}, {"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "C"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "ops"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "left"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "ops"}]}]},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 20},
      "id": 3,
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum(rate(k6_expected_throttles_total{service=\"deskseed\",environment=~\"$environment\",test_run_id=\"$test_run_id\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",profile=~\"$profile\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "expected 429/s", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "k6_unexpected_status_rate{service=\"deskseed\",environment=~\"$environment\",test_run_id=\"$test_run_id\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",profile=~\"$profile\"}", "legendFormat": "{{scenario}} unexpected ratio (cumulative)", "refId": "B"},
        {"expr": "sum by (instance) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-backend\",environment=~\"$environment\",uri=~\"$route\",status=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} server 5xx/s", "refId": "C"}
      ],
      "title": "Expected throttling, unexpected responses, and server 5xx",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "선택 시간대 counter 증가 추정값입니다. 시계열이 없으면 미수집/미발생 여부를 summary에서 확인합니다. dropped 원인은 VU/발생기 부족 또는 서버 지연일 수 있습니다. 정확한 최종 건수와 중단 여부는 실행 결과를 사용합니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "unit": "short", "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "red", "value": 1}]}, "noValue": "No data"}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 28},
      "id": 4,
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum(increase(k6_dropped_iterations_total{service=\"deskseed\",environment=~\"$environment\",test_run_id=\"$test_run_id\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",profile=~\"$profile\"}[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "dropped", "refId": "A", "instant": true}
      ],
      "title": "Dropped iterations (window estimate)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "2xx/3xx server response만 포함한 route별 latency입니다. 오류 응답의 빠른 실패가 성공 latency를 낮춰 보이지 않게 분리합니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "unit": "s", "noValue": "No data"}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 28},
      "id": 5,
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (instance, le, method, uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-backend\",environment=~\"$environment\",uri=~\"$route\",status=~\"2..|3..\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{method}} {{uri}} p95", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (instance, le, method, uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-backend\",environment=~\"$environment\",uri=~\"$route\",status=~\"2..|3..\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{method}} {{uri}} p99", "refId": "B"}
      ],
      "title": "Backend successful response p95 / p99",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "route와 status별 backend 처리율입니다. traffic mix가 바뀌었는지 먼저 확인합니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "unit": "reqps", "noValue": "No data"}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 36},
      "id": 6,
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum by (instance, method, uri, status) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-backend\",environment=~\"$environment\",uri=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{method}} {{uri}} {{status}}", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "Backend request rate by route / status",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "Nginx가 받은 요청률과 현재 active connection입니다. backend rate와 차이가 커지면 proxy/client 경계를 확인합니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "noValue": "No data", "unit": "ops"}, "overrides": [{"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "A"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "ops"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "left"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "ops"}]}, {"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "B"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "short"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "short"}]}]},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 36},
      "id": 7,
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "rate(nginx_http_requests_total{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-nginx\",environment=~\"$environment\"}[$__rate_interval])", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} requests/s", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "nginx_connections_active{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-nginx\",environment=~\"$environment\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} active connections", "refId": "B"}
      ],
      "title": "Nginx requests / active connections",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "backend process CPU와 heap limit 대비 사용률입니다. 링크는 같은 시간 범위의 Diagnostics CPU flame graph로 이동합니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"links": [{"title": "Open time-aligned CPU profile", "url": "/d/deskseed-load-diagnostics/deskseed-load-diagnostics?${__url_time_range}&var-environment=$environment&viewPanel=319"}], "max": 1, "min": 0, "unit": "percentunit", "noValue": "No data"}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 44},
      "id": 8,
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "process_cpu_usage{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-backend\",environment=~\"$environment\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} process CPU", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "sum by (instance) (jvm_memory_used_bytes{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-backend\",environment=~\"$environment\",area=\"heap\"}) / clamp_min(sum by (instance) (jvm_memory_max_bytes{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-backend\",environment=~\"$environment\",area=\"heap\"}), 1)", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} heap", "refId": "B"}
      ],
      "title": "JVM CPU and heap utilization",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "active/idle/pending connection으로 application-side DB saturation을 봅니다. pending이 지속되면 query와 DB 여유를 함께 확인합니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "unit": "short", "noValue": "No data"}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 44},
      "id": 9,
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "hikaricp_connections_active{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-backend\",pool=~\"$pool\",environment=~\"$environment\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{pool}} active", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "hikaricp_connections_idle{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-backend\",pool=~\"$pool\",environment=~\"$environment\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{pool}} idle", "refId": "B"},
        {"expr": "hikaricp_connections_pending{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-backend\",pool=~\"$pool\",environment=~\"$environment\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{pool}} pending", "refId": "C"}
      ],
      "title": "Hikari saturation",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "PostgreSQL connection 수와 commit/rollback 처리율입니다. statement diagnostics는 상세 dashboard에서 확인합니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "noValue": "No data", "unit": "short"}, "overrides": [{"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "A"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "short"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "left"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "short"}]}, {"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "B"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "ops"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "ops"}]}, {"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "C"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "ops"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "ops"}]}]},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 52},
      "id": 10,
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum by (instance) (pg_stat_database_numbackends{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-postgresql\",datname=\"$database\",environment=~\"$environment\"})", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} connections", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "sum by (instance) (rate(pg_stat_database_xact_commit{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-postgresql\",datname=\"$database\",environment=~\"$environment\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} commits/s", "refId": "B"},
        {"expr": "sum by (instance) (rate(pg_stat_database_xact_rollback{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-postgresql\",datname=\"$database\",environment=~\"$environment\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} rollbacks/s", "refId": "C"}
      ],
      "title": "PostgreSQL connections / transactions",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "Redis memory와 eviction/rejected connection입니다. AUTH-006 실행 중 eviction이 발생하면 결과를 무효로 처리합니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "noValue": "No data", "unit": "bytes"}, "overrides": [{"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "A"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "bytes"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "left"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "bytes"}]}, {"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "B"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "ops"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "ops"}]}, {"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "C"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "ops"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "ops"}]}]},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 52},
      "id": 11,
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "redis_memory_used_bytes{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-redis\",environment=~\"$environment\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} memory bytes", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "rate(redis_evicted_keys_total{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-redis\",environment=~\"$environment\"}[$__rate_interval])", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} evictions/s", "refId": "B"},
        {"expr": "rate(redis_rejected_connections_total{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-redis\",environment=~\"$environment\"}[$__rate_interval])", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} rejected/s", "refId": "C"}
      ],
      "title": "Redis memory / failures",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "host별 CPU 사용률입니다. 개별 container CPU·throttling·memory는 Diagnostics에서 확인합니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "unit": "percentunit", "noValue": "No data"}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 60},
      "id": 12,
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "1 - avg by (instance) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-node\",environment=~\"$environment\",mode=\"idle\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} host CPU", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "Host CPU utilization",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "mail/webhook 대기 개수와 가장 오래된 작업 나이입니다. backlog가 작아도 age가 증가하면 worker stall입니다.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "noValue": "No data", "unit": "short"}, "overrides": [{"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "A"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "short"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "left"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "short"}]}, {"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "B"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "s"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "s"}]}, {"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "C"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "short"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "left"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "short"}]}, {"matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "D"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "s"}, {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right"}, {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "s"}]}]},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 60},
      "id": 13,
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "deskseed_mail_outbox_backlog{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-backend\",environment=~\"$environment\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} mail count", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "deskseed_mail_outbox_oldest_age_seconds{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-backend\",environment=~\"$environment\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} mail oldest age", "refId": "B"},
        {"expr": "deskseed_webhook_delivery_backlog{stack=\"deskseed\",host=~\"$host\",job=\"deskseed-backend\",environment=~\"$environment\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} webhook count", "refId": "C"},
